# yaniktoim site — published to GitHub Pages.
# Whitelist mentality: anything not part of a rendered page or asset stays
# out of gh-pages. If you need to publish a new asset type, allow it
# explicitly here rather than relaxing this list.

# Editor / OS detritus.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs & temp.
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Underscore-prefixed working directories (mirror of yaniktoim/_logs, _notes…).
_*/
_*.html
_*.md
_*.txt

# Python noise (in case a tool ever spits something here).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Anything stashed by accident.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
